WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:01.125
- [Narrator:] Football.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.666
Is.

00:00:03.541 --> 00:00:04.166
Back.

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:06.458
Pr—probably.

