We—we think it's coming back, but wh—who knows.

00:00:10.416 --> 00:00:11.333
Either way,

00:00:12.541 --> 00:00:14.625
Gridiron Heights returns.

00:00:15.083 --> 00:00:17.250
- Andrew Reid won a Super Bowl!

00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:18.541
- What's in the box score?

00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:21.083
