00:00:27.583 --> 00:00:30.541
- I will destroy this game, and redefine it in my image!

00:00:30.708 --> 00:00:32.375
- Everyone calm down. This will blow over.

00:00:32.708 --> 00:00:34.666
- [Narrator:] Tuesdays this fall on Bleacher Report.

